[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="CasChapterSceneVisual" load_steps=24 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_scene_resource.gd" id="1_scene"]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_line_resource.gd" id="2_line"]

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_0"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="回接那趟的航迹留在海图上，像从旧线旁边长出一根岔枝。你想把多余的擦掉，给新任务腾地方，莫里按住橡皮，说先留着，她有话要问。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_1"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="你当时为什么选这边？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_2"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我看空隙比较大。后面的船不用急转。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_3"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="好。这一点我没意见。可你先叫我的时候没说有一艘慢船要回接，我以为你让我去探，开得快了一点。下次我该听哪一句判断？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_4"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你翻记录，发现自己确实只发了路线，没有报这条路线为什么临时改变。那时候你以为大家都跟着同一个目标在想，实际上只有你看着那张刚更新过的图。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_5"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="不是你没听清，是我没说。我应该先报回接目标、谁是队尾，再说路线。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_6"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="嗯。你这么说我就能改。不然你一直跟我道歉，我还得花力气猜你下次想让我变成什么样。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_7"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="她把两只杯子摆到图旁边，模拟刚才的先后。你说出一条新命令，她照着自己能知道的信息执行，故意不使用你还没报的那段。船线很快又错开了一点。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_8"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我得把等候位置也说出来。不能只说“等一下”。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_9"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="对。你脑子里的“这儿”和我眼睛里的“这儿”隔着半张海。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_10"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你们又试一遍。这一次没有急着走完整段，先让两个人都能复述第一步，确认以后再动。德雷顿端来热水，见桌面摆满杯子，站在门口迟疑了一会儿，说自己今天特别怕把水放错队。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_11"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="哪只是用来喝的？我可不想一口把你们的队尾喝没。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_12"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="有把的都是真水。没把的是演练。这条不许再改了，我下午就靠它分。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_13"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你把杯子的区别也记下来。看似鸡毛蒜皮的约定一旦说清楚，后面反倒不需要每一步解释。你们终于能把注意力放在真正变化的海况上，而不是猜谁刚才省了哪个字。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_14"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="你是不是还不太信我？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_15"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="有些地方不信。比如你会不会为了去查自己的事突然改命令，我还没见够。但刚才你肯把没说清的认下来，我能少防一件。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_16"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="如果我想改呢？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_17"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="说出来。给我一个能判断的目标和代价。我可能同意，也可能觉得很蠢，咱们再吵。别等我已经开出去，才发现自己是在替你赌另一件事。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_18"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="她的态度没有一下变得亲近，你却不再觉得这是一扇怎么敲都不开的门。她指出的是具体的事，甚至愿意陪你在桌上把它重走一遍。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_19"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="演练完把结论交给帕金斯，我们下次都用。不单给新来的立规矩，也包括我临时改口的时候。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_20"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="莫里把最后一只杯子放回托盘，拿起真正的水喝了一口，皱眉说已经凉了。德雷顿让她等等，自己又去换一壶。这一次，没有谁因为说过了难听的话，就觉得后面的热水不该递给她。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["maury", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

